@title Moonlit Harbor alpha status
@subtitle Lanternfish Games, for the publisher. As of week 42 (ending 2026-10-16)
@author Zuri Okonkwo-Hale, Producer. Alpha review: 2026-11-20

Overall status: Amber.

kpi Features | 31 of 40 | 77.5% complete | neutral
kpi Levels playable | 14 of 18 | | neutral
kpi Open bugs | 212 | 9 are priority 1 | bad
kpi Frame rate | 58 fps | target 60 fps on minimum-spec console | bad

## Alpha at a glance
We have 31 of 40 planned features complete (77.5%). 14 of 18 levels are playable. The average frame rate on the minimum-spec console is 58 frames per second, against a target of 60.

## Bug trend
data bugs = week,open bugs; W37,340; W38,318; W39,291; W40,264; W41,238; W42,212
chart line bugs x=week y=open bugs labels=all title="Open bugs by week"

Open bugs are falling by about 26 a week. At that rate, about 80 will be open by 2026-11-20.

## Features
The 9 remaining features are:
- In progress (4): fishing mini-game, ship customization, co-op invites, photo mode.
- Not started (3): harbor festival events, achievements, accessibility options.
- Cut candidates (2): weather-driven trading, pet companion. Cutting both would save about 6 weeks of work.

## Risks
- Performance is 2 frames per second below target in the busiest harbor scene. The optimization sprint is booked for 2026-11-02 to 2026-11-13.
- Accessibility options have not started, and they are required for the console certification submission on 2027-02-08.
- The decision on the two cut candidates is needed by 2026-10-30.
